 "remarks": "Enjoy the convenience of living in the heart of Norwalk, ideally situated between three vibrant neighborhoods-Wall Street, West Avenue, and SoNo. Restaurants, shopping, entertainment, and local attractions are all just steps away. Completely rebuilt in 2008, this freshly painted condo features hardwood floors, crown molding, and granite countertops in both the kitchen and bath. Additional conveniences include on-site laundry and storage. Commuters will appreciate the easy access to Metro-North trains and major highways. A wonderful opportunity to enjoy all that Norwalk has to offer right outside your door!",
